{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a lone rabbit sent to the outer space on the journey back home. Defend the ship against relentless alien waves, harvest precious resources, upgrade under pressure, and survive the crushing energy deficit. Every warp brings you one step closer to home\u2026 or to ruin.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3044420/extras/843bb6027d516631d0ebf1fb3e95aa60.poster.avif?t=1762760188\" width=800 height=126 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3044420/extras/843bb6027d516631d0ebf1fb3e95aa60.webm?t=1762760188\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are not in a safe place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From time to time, swarms of local aliens will attack your ship.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build <strong>defenses</strong>, stay prepared, and you\u2019ll survive!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3044420/extras/849ed81d9ecca9b876d6a64f50750d3f.poster.avif?t=1762760188\" width=1170 height=192 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3044420/extras/849ed81d9ecca9b876d6a64f50750d3f.webm?t=1762760188\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Resources are limited, so you\u2019ll need to <strong>harvest</strong> constantly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yes \u2014 all the time. Don\u2019t skip it!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3044420/extras/e006e57e9490cfbe328ff8dd791bc258.poster.avif?t=1762760188\" width=800 height=148 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3044420/extras/e006e57e9490cfbe328ff8dd791bc258.webm?t=1762760188\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don\u2019t forget to <strong>upgrade</strong> your ship!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are many useful perks you can unlock to make your journey a little easier.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3044420/extras/28a354c766adefa7c4ed1aaa70af327e.poster.avif?t=1762760188\" width=1170 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3044420/extras/28a354c766adefa7c4ed1aaa70af327e.webm?t=1762760188\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore</strong> the hostile void and find your way home!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3044420?t=1762760188","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3044420/4a954f84c52f0e34f9af73793391de268d3e1534/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1762760188","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3044420/da55b70b3ac71a4bde2502ef1153f1d56b1323dc/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762760188","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3044420/da55b70b3ac71a4bde2502ef1153f1d56b1323dc/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762760188","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids"